| A6000 | 0.524 | 0.365 (1.44×) | 0.305 (1.72×) | 0.277 (1.89×) |
| A100 | 0.253 | 0.195 (1.30×) | 0.176 (1.44×) | 0.155 (1.63×) |
| H100 | 0.253 | 0.134 (1.26×) | 0.176 (1.44×) | 0.155 (1.63×) |

